///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
:START
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
:WARZONE_NAME Georgia
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
:TITLE Caspian Black Gold
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
:SHORT_TEXT_START
In GEORGIA a brand new hyper-nationalistic
Russian government is determined to wipe out
the humiliations of the post-Soviet era and
take control of the Caspian Sea oilfields. The
only force that can stand in the way of their
whirlwind advance is a battalion of US attack
helicopters in north-eastern Turkey.
:TEXT_END
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

:CAMPAIGN_DATA
:FILENAME ..\COMMON\MAPS\MAP3\CAMPAIGN\GEORGIA.SID
:FILENAME ..\COMMON\MAPS\MAP3\CAMPAIGN\GEORGIA.BIN

:MAP_X_SIZE 122
:MAP_Z_SIZE 58
:MAP_SECTOR_SIZE 4096

:FACTION
:SIDE SIDE_BLUE_FORCE
:COLOUR COL_BLUE

:FACTION
:SIDE SIDE_RED_FORCE
:COLOUR COL_RED

:DATE 26 11 1998

:PLANNER_DATA
:ZOOM 5

:TOUR_OF_DUTY
:HOURS 1
:MINUTES 30
:SECONDS 0

///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
:FACTION
:SIDE SIDE_BLUE_FORCE
:COLOUR COL_BLUE
:ATTITUDE FORCE_ATTITUDE_NORMAL
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

:TASK_GENERATION
:TYPE TASK_ADVANCE 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_CLOSE_AIR_SUPPORT 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_COMBAT_AIR_PATROL 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_DEEP_STRIKE 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_ENGAGE 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_INTERCEPT 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_PICK_UP_AND_DROP_OFF 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_RECON 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_REPAIR 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_RETREAT 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_RETURN 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_SCOUT 1 1 50
:TYPE TASK_SECTOR_RECON 1 1 50
:TYPE TASK_SUPPRESSION_OF_ENEMY_AIR_DEFENCES 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_TRANSFER 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_TROOP_INSERTION 50 50 50
:TYPE TASK_VISIT 50 50 50

:HARDWARE_RESERVES
:TYPE ARMED_FIXED_WING
:COUNT 20
:TYPE UNARMED_FIXED_WING
:COUNT 0
:TYPE ARMED_HELICOPTER
:COUNT 20
:TYPE UNARMED_HELICOPTER
:COUNT 10
:TYPE ARMED_ROUTED_VEHICLE
:COUNT 20
:TYPE UNARMED_ROUTED_VEHICLE
:COUNT 10
:TYPE ARMED_SHIP_VEHICLE
:COUNT 5
:TYPE UNARMED_SHIP_VEHICLE
:COUNT 2

:FRONTLINE_FORCES 10

:CAMPAIGN_CRITERIA
        :CRITERIA CAPTURED_SECTORS
        :GOAL 55
        :RESULT SUCCESS
        :CRITERIA BALANCE_OF_POWER
        :GOAL 50
        :RESULT SUCCESS

